  <item>
    <title>VOL31-情人节特辑-当一个爱自己的疯批</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63e8e744e99bdef7d38a0913</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63e8e744e99bdef7d38a0913</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 12 Feb 2023 13:18:59 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgSa99AYGiaYtEf_P1n0whiaovex.PNG"></figure><span></span><p><span>情人节快到了，除了谈情说爱，我们想聊聊关于发疯这件事～</span></p><span></span><p><span>发疯是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span>南北说：</span></p><span></span><p><span>发疯，就是-房间着火我拍照 人生乱套我睡觉 发烧生病不吃药</span></p><span></span><p><span>发疯，就是一场精神上的赛博朋克</span></p><span></span><p><span>发疯，就是一场对自我酣畅淋漓的爱</span></p><span></span><p><span>发疯，是为了更好的活着</span></p><span></span><p><span>时奕说：</span></p><span></span><p><span>发疯，就是一场他人皆醒我独醉的微醺</span></p><span></span><p><span>发疯，就是自创勇敢与胜利的战役</span></p><span></span><p><span>发疯，就是我爱我自己的最高级尊重的褒奖</span></p><span></span><p><span>发疯，是为了找寻我自己</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期shownotes：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="147">02:27</a>你见过凌晨四点的北京吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="322">05:22</a>你为什么要插队啊？他说，因为我没礼貌呀</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="549">09:09</a>在发光和发热中选择了发疯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="839">13:59</a>第一个说我疯了的人是我爸</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1646">27:26</a>看着同事在街上跳女团舞，我举起了摄像机</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1848">30:48</a>大家都太能忍了，忍耐比改变更容易</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2731">45:31</a>发疯就是一场对自我酣畅淋漓的爱，发疯就是为了更好的爱自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3189">53:09</a>别担心，有一天你会很漂亮</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3263">54:23</a>平凡这个词，它其实也是一个很高级的一个点缀</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3358">55:58</a>当关注点回到自己的身上，我才发现我好像慢慢开始爱自己了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3502">58:22</a>与其当一个完美的人，不如做一个完整的人</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢大家的收听，我们下期再见咯～</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM:</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;Rain and Teeas</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们的歌</span></p><span></span><p><span>封面设计：南北</span></p><span></span><p><span>播客剪辑：南北</span></p><span></span><p><span>播客主播：时奕/南北</span></p><span></span><p><span>小小根据地</span></p><span></span><p><span>Weibo：时言北语</span></p>]]></description>
